  },
  data: {
    LLM: "Don't be the first to act! Watch the veterans. If they say 'Have a nice Day' every time they play a 7, YOU should say it too. Most of Mao is pattern recognition.\n\nThe 'Chairman' Trap: If you are the Chairman, use your power to confuse new players. Give penalties for 'Failure to be Awesome' or 'Breathing too loudly'. This forces players to think outside the literal mechanics of the cards.\n\nRule-Stacking: If you win, create a rule that is triggered by a common action. For example, 'Every time a Red 4 is played, the person who played it must stand up.' Combine this with existing rules to create complex sequences of required actions.",
    Player: "Don't be the first to act! Watch the veterans. If they say 'Have a nice Day' every time they play a 7, YOU should say it too. Most of Mao is pattern recognition.\n\nThe 'Chairman' Trap: If you are the Chairman, use your power to confuse new players. Give penalties for 'Failure to be Awesome' or 'Breathing too loudly'. This forces players to think outside the literal mechanics of the cards.\n\nRule-Stacking: If you win, create a rule that is triggered by a common action. For example, 'Every time a Red 4 is played, the person who played it must stand up.' Combine this with existing rules to create complex sequences of required actions.",
    aggressiveness: 0.5,
    riskTolerance: 0.5,
    bluffFrequency: 0.3,
    bluffSettings: {
      profile: 'balanced',
    },
    basic: "Don't be the first to act! Watch the veterans. If they say 'Have a nice Day' every time they play a 7, YOU should say it too. Most of Mao is pattern recognition.",
    intermediate: "The 'Chairman' Trap: If you are the Chairman, use your power to confuse new players. Give penalties for 'Failure to be Awesome' or 'Breathing too loudly'. This forces players to think outside the literal mechanics of the cards.",
    advanced: "Rule-Stacking: If you win, create a rule that is triggered by a common action. For example, 'Every time a Red 4 is played, the person who played it must stand up.' Combine this with existing rules to create complex sequences of required actions.",
    tips: [
      {
        title: 'Tip',
        description: "Keep a straight face. If you laugh at a penalty, you might get another penalty for 'Illegal Joy'.",
      },
      {
        title: 'Tip',
        description: "If you are stuck, call a 'Point of Order'. It's the only safe time to observe the table without cards in hand.",
      },
